# Production build (Vite) — set in Render Static Site → Environment (build-time).
# Do not commit real service URLs here; configure in Render Dashboard.
#
# Required for AI Chat + React API calls when frontend is a separate Static Site:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-rentalai-api.onrender.com
#
# On the API service (rentalai-api), allow your Static Site origin:
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-rentalai-frontend.onrender.com
